愛し愛されてこの命は
Loving and being loved, this life

149
00:17:09,871 --> 00:17:12,871
芽吹いて咲いて
sprouts and blooms.

150
00:17:12,871 --> 00:17:16,071
色褪せない眼差しを胸に
Holding an unfading gaze in my heart,

151
00:17:16,071 --> 00:17:19,571
舞い散る願い
my wishes scatter like petals.

